        "subject": "LU-20177 mdd: fix '..' for namespace-only moves",
        "message": "LU-20177 mdd: fix '..' for namespace-only moves\n\nNamespace-only moves between parent stripes can leave '..' pointing\nat the old parent, including stripe shrink and other migration paths.\n\nUpdate '..' in the MDD namespace-only migration path.  When the\nobject is already on the target MDT and parent stripes differ,\nmark it namespace-only in MDD rather than retrying in MDT reint.\nThis avoids a second attribute fetch and sanity check.\n\nVerify '..' with namespace LFSCK in sanity/230C.\n\nFixes: 23de90c02fc3 (\"LU-20177 mdt: Directory migration fails with not-empty error\")\nSigned-off-by: Rajeev Mishra <rajeevm@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: Ibe1cf2a9b576b50312f18f4f39c872ea1af25846\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
